        {
          "text": "Te ewu Yeroboamuni opi nyazuri ovu eli kali iri drini iri; eri la a’bipi emi ’diyi be, azini mvi erini Nadabu nya opi eri ma pariani. Rehoboamuni opi nyazuri ",
